ext{L9}$ follows from line $\\text{L7}$ by  \n{{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L2}.$ Differentiating $y(t)={e}^{-At}x(t)$ and applying the product rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =({e}^{-At})^{′}x(t)+{e}^{-At}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(-A){e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =-A{e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}{x}^{′}(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L2}$ follows from $\\text{L1}$ by $\\text{differentiating and using the product rule}.$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L4}$, $\\text{L5}$, and $\\text{L6}.$ From $\\text{L4}$ we have\n\n$$\ny(t)-y(0)={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nUsing $y(0)=x(0)$ from $\\text{L5}$, this becomes\n\n$$\ny(t)-x(0)={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nso\n\n$$\ny(t)=x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L6}$ follows from $\\text{L4}$ by substituting $y(0)=x(0).$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L7}$, $\\text{L8}$, and $\\text{L9}.$ From $\\text{L8}$ we know that\n\n$$\n{e}^{At}y(t)=x(t).\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${e}^{At}y(t)=x(t)$ into\n\n$$\n{e}^{At}y(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s\n$$\n\nfrom $\\text{L7}$ gives\n\n$$\nx(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{L9}$ follows from $\\text{L7}$ by $\\text{substituting }{e}^{At}y(t)=x(t).$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186396735 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb2b0c4a-5f41-51b1-b049-b17c6daa263c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating at $t=0$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396737} {:answer/id #uuid "4db61969-a679-5616-b6d7-9ef5595f083e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "applying a change of variables" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186396738} {:answer/id #uuid "b001af69-f2b3-5389-9b56-04a143bc76e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "subs